# logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

.vercel

# Android signing material. Committing any of this would let anyone publish
# an update impersonating this app, so it never enters the repository — the
# keystore lives only on the machine that builds releases, and is backed up
# out of band. See apps/mobile/README.md.
*.jks
*.keystore
**/key.properties

# Firestore/Auth emulator seed data (local demo only)
.emulator-data/
